{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"平\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y把人物当下的处境、心理变化和前后因果交代得更清楚，尤其S01—S07，主要信息不容易被拆散。small：Y的小字补充的角度更多，像“外头像给众人看的舞步，心里却只哼自己的旧歌”和“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”，都能增加理解层次；X的小字也比较贴合，但有些与大字意思重叠。core：平，两版都持续呈现不愿再受委屈与怀念旧日亲近、归属之间的拉扯，最后也都落在不牺牲尊严地继续生活上。concise：Y合并了X中不少分开表达的近义内容，整体重复较少。human：X略好，Y有“活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题”“心里的愿望向远方发出”“不愿只凭这点指望回去忍让”等搭配或语意关系不够自然的地方。fine：X的感受更集中于观众当下的身体和心理体验，如胸口发紧、伸手摸空、后颈发凉、脚下失去重心；Y有些感受直接转成了对音乐本身的描述。load：X明显更好，尤其S11、S12，短块落在相对自然的意群边界，22秒和25秒内更容易扫完；Y虽然大块数量少，但单块过长，S11尤其明显。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "29bb5341-2449-44eb-b433-9c98798706d5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T051336400219Z", "elapsed_seconds": 248.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:17:44.848006+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7e4d9af11d5220e7696d80d966bacb076e67a2708611461f853a180f54570c83", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"